#. ja: 第四次復興用の幻風枝【検】
#. de: inspiziert[a] Himmelsang-Windseelenzweig
#. fr: branche des vents évanescents de restauration expertisée (4e phase)
#. column 2: approved grade 4 skybuilders' umbral galewood branches
#. column 8: The billowing wind-aspected aether that surrounds this branch might lead some to think it would be the ideal material from which to make a magic wand. Unfortunately, the energies within it are so powerful, the wielder would struggle to even hold on to it long enough to cast any spells before it blows right out of their hands.<br><br>Can only be gathered during an umbral tempest.<br><br>Used in expert crafting recipes.
#. column 9: Approved Grade 4 Skybuilders' Umbral Galewood Branch
msgctxt "Item:32001:0:0"
msgid "approved grade 4 skybuilders' umbral galewood branch"
msgstr "ветвь сумрачного ветролесья для небесных строителей, 4-й сорт"

