#. column 2: tufts of grade 4 skybuilders' sesame
#. column 8: The sesame plant is robust enough to grow in even the most inhospitable environments, including those in which the botanists tasked with gathering said plant are incapable of surviving. As valuable as sesame is, most would agree it is not worth risking life and limb for, not that the skybuilders seem particularly bothered by this when making their requests...<br><br>Used in level 40 crafting recipes.
