#. fr: Sel gemme supérieur de restauration (4e phase)
#. column 0: chunk of grade 4 skybuilders' rock salt
#. column 2: chunks of grade 4 skybuilders' rock salt
#. column 8: “But Mother, can we not break the salt rock into smaller chunks to save us all from having to lick the same piece? It seems awfully unhygienic.”<br>“No, my sweet prince, that would not be proper. Now lick the rock and put it back on the table.”<br>─Typical Ishgardian mealtime conversation<br><br>Used in level 40 crafting recipes.
msgctxt "Item:32013:0:9"
msgid "Grade 4 Skybuilders' Rock Salt"
msgstr "Каменная соль для небесных строителей, 4-й сорт"

#. ja: 第四次復興用の中級精霊銀砂
