#. column 8: Judging by its volume, perhaps “Mistbeard's flagon” would have been a more apt name.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
msgctxt "Item:32067:0:9"
msgid "Mistbeard's Cup"
msgstr "Чаша Туманного Бородача"

#. ja: アノマロカリス・サロン
#. de: Anomalocaris Saron
#. fr: anomalocaris saron
#. column 2: anomalocaris sarons
#. column 8: At a certain point in history, this wavekin simply stopped evolving. Its lackluster appearance would suggest that this is not due to having achieved unsurpassable perfection, but rather a lack of ambition on the part of the species as a whole.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Anomalocaris Saron
msgctxt "Item:32068:0:0"
msgid "anomalocaris saron"
msgstr "Аномалокарис сарон"

#. de: Anomalocaris Saron
#. fr: anomalocarides saron
#. column 0: anomalocaris saron
#. column 8: At a certain point in history, this wavekin simply stopped evolving. Its lackluster appearance would suggest that this is not due to having achieved unsurpassable perfection, but rather a lack of ambition on the part of the species as a whole.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Anomalocaris Saron
msgctxt "Item:32068:0:2"
msgid "anomalocaris sarons"
msgstr "Аномалокарисы сароны"

#. ja: エーテル流を追って泳ぐ古代生物<br>シェルダレー諸島沖合の稀少魚<br>[魚拓額縁G2に設定可能]
#. de: Ein tentakeliger Albtraum aus uralten Zeiten. In seinem Haus zu Cieldalaes wartet Anomalocaris Saron träumend. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe M ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Cet animal ancestral assoiffé d'éther recherche en permanence les courants spectraux.<br>Rarissime, on l'aperçoit parfois au large des îles de Cieldalaes.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de taille moyenne]
#. column 0: anomalocaris saron
#. column 2: anomalocaris sarons
#. column 9: Anomalocaris Saron
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:32068:0:8"
msgid "At a certain point in history, this wavekin simply stopped evolving. Its lackluster appearance would suggest that this is not due to having achieved unsurpassable perfection, but rather a lack of ambition on the part of the species as a whole.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]"
msgstr "В какой-то момент это морское существо просто перестало эволюционировать. Судя по его невзрачному виду, дело тут не в том, что оно достигло недосягаемого совершенства, а в отсутствии амбиций у всего вида.<br><br>[Можно выставить в раме среднего размера.]"

#. ja: アノマロカリス・サロン
#. de: Anomalocaris Saron
#. fr: Anomalocaris saron
#. column 0: anomalocaris saron
#. column 2: anomalocaris sarons
#. column 8: At a certain point in history, this wavekin simply stopped evolving. Its lackluster appearance would suggest that this is not due to having achieved unsurpassable perfection, but rather a lack of ambition on the part of the species as a whole.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
msgctxt "Item:32068:0:9"
msgid "Anomalocaris Saron"
msgstr "Аномалокарис сарон"

#. ja: フレイミングイール
#. de: Flammenaal
#. fr: murène flamboyante
#. column 2: flaming eels
#. column 8: Sought more for its oil than for its meat, which is─as one might expect─rather oily.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Flaming Eel
msgctxt "Item:32069:0:0"
msgid "flaming eel"
msgstr "Пламенный угорь"

#. de: Flammenaale
#. fr: murènes flamboyantes
#. column 0: flaming eel
#. column 8: Sought more for its oil than for its meat, which is─as one might expect─rather oily.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Flaming Eel
msgctxt "Item:32069:0:2"
msgid "flaming eels"
msgstr "Пламенные угри"

#. ja: 炎紋状の模様を持つウツボの一種<br>シェルダレー諸島沖合の稀少魚<br>[魚拓額縁G2に設定可能]
#. de: Mit diesem Namen ist der Flammenaal wirklich der heißeste Fisch im Ozean. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe M ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: La peau de cette murène fait penser à une traînée de flammes.<br>Rarissime, on l'aperçoit parfois au large des îles de Cieldalaes.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de taille moyenne]
#. column 0: flaming eel
#. column 2: flaming eels
#. column 9: Flaming Eel
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:32069:0:8"
msgid "Sought more for its oil than for its meat, which is─as one might expect─rather oily.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]"
msgstr "Его ценят за масло, а не за мясо, которое, как и следовало ожидать, весьма жирное.<br><br>[Можно выставить в раме среднего размера.]"

