msgctxt "Item:32069:0:9"
msgid "Flaming Eel"
msgstr "Пламенный угорь"

#. ja: ジェットフライマンタ
#. de: Düsenmanta
#. fr: manta à réaction
#. column 2: jetborne mantas
#. column 8: Clever fishers will often latch onto one of these wavekin and use its extraordinary propulsion to pull their ships. Once it grows tired, they can repay its kindness by hauling it out of the water and eating it.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Jetborne Manta
msgctxt "Item:32070:0:0"
msgid "jetborne manta"
msgstr "Реактивная манта"

#. de: Düsenmantas
#. fr: mantas à réaction
#. column 0: jetborne manta
#. column 8: Clever fishers will often latch onto one of these wavekin and use its extraordinary propulsion to pull their ships. Once it grows tired, they can repay its kindness by hauling it out of the water and eating it.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Jetborne Manta
msgctxt "Item:32070:0:2"
msgid "jetborne mantas"
msgstr "Реактивные манты"

#. ja: エーテル流に乗り高速で泳ぐマンタ<br>シェルダレー諸島沖合の稀少魚<br>[魚拓額縁G3に設定可能]
#. de: Mit Düsen ist alles besser. Auch dieser Manta. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe L ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Cette manta peut atteindre des vitesses ini<shy>ma<shy>gi<shy>na<shy>bles dans un courant spectral.<br>Rarissime, on l'aperçoit parfois au large des îles de Cieldalaes.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de grande taille]
#. column 0: jetborne manta
#. column 2: jetborne mantas
#. column 9: Jetborne Manta
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:32070:0:8"
msgid "Clever fishers will often latch onto one of these wavekin and use its extraordinary propulsion to pull their ships. Once it grows tired, they can repay its kindness by hauling it out of the water and eating it.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]"
msgstr "Находчивые рыбаки часто цепляются за эту рыбу и используют её невероятную тягу, чтобы тянуть корабль. А когда она устанет, в благодарность её вытаскивают из воды и съедают.<br><br>[Можно выставить в раме большого размера.]"

#. ja: ジェットフライマンタ
#. de: Düsenmanta
#. fr: Manta à réaction
#. column 0: jetborne manta
#. column 2: jetborne mantas
#. column 8: Clever fishers will often latch onto one of these wavekin and use its extraordinary propulsion to pull their ships. Once it grows tired, they can repay its kindness by hauling it out of the water and eating it.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
msgctxt "Item:32070:0:9"
msgid "Jetborne Manta"
msgstr "Реактивная манта"

#. ja: デビルスティンガー
#. de: Teufelsstachel
#. fr: dard-du-démon
#. column 2: devil's stings
#. column 8: It is best to catch this vicious wavekin before it catches you.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Devil's Sting
msgctxt "Item:32071:0:0"
msgid "devil's sting"
msgstr "Дьявольское жало"

#. de: Teufelsstachel
#. fr: dards-du-démon
#. column 0: devil's sting
#. column 8: It is best to catch this vicious wavekin before it catches you.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Devil's Sting
msgctxt "Item:32071:0:2"
msgid "devil's stings"
msgstr "Дьявольские жала"

#. ja: 幻海流により浮上した大型の深海魚<br>シェルダレー諸島沖合の稀少魚<br>[魚拓額縁G2に設定可能]
#. de: Dieser Fisch vereint zwei überaus garstige Dinge<nbsp>- Teufel, die gemeinhin als extrem fies gelten, und Stacheln, die wirklich niemand gern im Fuß stecken hat. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe M ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Un poisson des profondeurs que les courants spectraux font parfois remonter vers la surface.<br>Rarissime, on l'aperçoit parfois au large des îles de Cieldalaes.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de taille moyenne]
#. column 0: devil's sting
#. column 2: devil's stings
#. column 9: Devil's Sting
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:32071:0:8"
msgid "It is best to catch this vicious wavekin before it catches you.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]"
msgstr "Лучше поймать эту свирепую рыбу прежде, чем она поймает вас.<br><br>[Можно выставить в раме среднего размера.]"

#. ja: デビルスティンガー
#. de: Teufelsstachel
#. fr: Dard-du-démon
