#. column 2: devil's stings
#. column 8: It is best to catch this vicious wavekin before it catches you.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
msgctxt "Item:32071:0:9"
msgid "Devil's Sting"
msgstr "Дьявольское жало"

#. ja: カリクティス
#. de: Panzerwels
#. fr: callichthyidé
#. column 2: callichthyids
#. column 8: Being extremely heavy and covered in armored plates, attempting to catch and eat this wavekin is often more trouble than it is worth. Many fishers will cut their lines upon realizing they have snagged one.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on extra large canvases.]
#. column 9: Callichthyid
msgctxt "Item:32072:0:0"
msgid "callichthyid"
msgstr "Калихтис"

#. de: Panzerwelse
#. fr: callichthyidés
#. column 0: callichthyid
#. column 8: Being extremely heavy and covered in armored plates, attempting to catch and eat this wavekin is often more trouble than it is worth. Many fishers will cut their lines upon realizing they have snagged one.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on extra large canvases.]
#. column 9: Callichthyid
msgctxt "Item:32072:0:2"
msgid "callichthyids"
msgstr "Калихтисы"

#. ja: 厚い鱗を装甲化させた巨大な甲冑魚<br>シェルダレー諸島沖合の稀少魚<br>[魚拓額縁G4に設定可能]
#. de: Kein Leopard, sondern ein Wels. Ein ziemlich strammer noch dazu. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe XL ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Les épaisses écailles de ce placoderme le protègent contre les plus violents chocs.<br>Rarissime, on l'aperçoit parfois au large des îles de Cieldalaes.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de très grande taille]
#. column 0: callichthyid
#. column 2: callichthyids
#. column 9: Callichthyid
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:32072:0:8"
msgid "Being extremely heavy and covered in armored plates, attempting to catch and eat this wavekin is often more trouble than it is worth. Many fishers will cut their lines upon realizing they have snagged one.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on extra large canvases.]"
msgstr "Эта рыба так тяжела и закована в броню, что ловить её ради мяса зачастую просто не стоит усилий. Многие рыбаки, поняв, что поймали её, попросту обрывают леску.<br><br>[Можно выставить в раме очень большого размера.]"

