msgid "Callichthyid"
msgstr "Калихтис"

#. ja: フローティング・モラ
#. de: Treibfisch
#. fr: lune-flottante
#. column 2: meandering Moras
#. column 8: Content to simply drift through life with barely a care in the world, this fish is so lazy that it feeds by opening its mouth on the off chance that something edible might find its way inside.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Meandering Mora
msgctxt "Item:32073:0:0"
msgid "meandering Mora"
msgstr "Блуждающая мора"

#. de: Treibfische
#. fr: lunes-flottantes
#. column 0: meandering Mora
#. column 8: Content to simply drift through life with barely a care in the world, this fish is so lazy that it feeds by opening its mouth on the off chance that something edible might find its way inside.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Meandering Mora
msgctxt "Item:32073:0:2"
msgid "meandering Moras"
msgstr "Блуждающие моры"

#. ja: 身を膨らませ幻海流中を漂うマンボウ<br>シェルダレー諸島沖合の稀少魚<br>[魚拓額縁G3に設定可能]
#. de: Warum sollte man sich mit Schwimmen verausgaben, wenn man auch einfach vor sich hin treiben kann? (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe L ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Ce poisson-lune gonfle son corps et se laisse porter par les courants spectraux.<br>Rarissime, on l'aperçoit parfois au large des îles de Cieldalaes.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de grande taille]
#. column 0: meandering Mora
#. column 2: meandering Moras
#. column 9: Meandering Mora
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:32073:0:8"
msgid "Content to simply drift through life with barely a care in the world, this fish is so lazy that it feeds by opening its mouth on the off chance that something edible might find its way inside.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]"
msgstr "Эта рыба беззаботно плывёт по жизни, почти ни о чём не беспокоясь. Она так ленива, что просто разевает рот в надежде, что туда само заплывёт что-нибудь съедобное.<br><br>[Можно выставить в раме большого размера.]"

