msgid "Hafgufa"
msgstr "Хафгуфа"

#. ja: サリャクリバークラブ
#. de: Thaliak-Krabbe
#. fr: crabe de la Thaliak
#. column 2: Thaliak crabs
#. column 8: Something of an anomaly among crabs as it spends its life moving back and forth between salt- and freshwater. Its flavor differs according to where it is caught.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Thaliak Crab
msgctxt "Item:32075:0:0"
msgid "Thaliak crab"
msgstr "краб Талиака"

