#. de: Sternsplitter
#. fr: étoile-du-Destructeur
#. column 2: Stars of the Destroyer
#. column 8: Believed by some to be living fragments of Rhalgr's beacon, their gentle glow from beneath the waves is a welcome sight to many a sailor.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Star of the Destroyer
msgctxt "Item:32076:0:0"
msgid "Star of the Destroyer"
msgstr "Звезда Разрушителя"

