#. ja: ブラッディハンプヘッド
#. de: Blutlippenfisch
#. fr: labre à bosse ensanglantée
#. column 2: blooded wrasse
#. column 8: Fishers should not feel guilty for the bloodstains on the fish's head, as these are largely self-inflicted. They can instead feel guilty about the hook through the mouth, as well as the gutting and cleaning that comes shortly after.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Blooded Wrasse
msgctxt "Item:32078:0:0"
msgid "blooded wrasse"
msgstr "кровавогубый губан"

