#. ja: ブラッディポリッシュ
#. de: Blutzangenkrabbe
#. fr: crabe verni
#. column 2: bloodpolish crabs
#. column 8: These wavekin cover their claws in blood to make themselves presentable to potential mates. Though this may seem odd, perhaps it is best not to attempt to understand the inner workings of a crab's mind.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Bloodpolish Crab
msgctxt "Item:32079:0:0"
msgid "bloodpolish crab"
msgstr "кровавый краб"

