msgstr "Кровавый краб"

#. ja: ブルーニードル
#. de: Blau[a] Nadel
#. fr: tisse-filet
#. column 2: blue stitchers
#. column 8: Considering its thin legs are often likened to needles, one cannot expect to get much meat from them. The torso, on the other hand, is a firm favorite among seafarers.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Blue Stitcher
msgctxt "Item:32080:0:0"
msgid "blue stitcher"
msgstr "голубой иглоног"

