#. ja: サンクンマスク
#. de: verschollen[a] Maske
#. fr: masque trempé
#. column 2: sunken masks
#. column 8: Though inanimate objects are seldom a welcome sight on a fisher's line, the goblin owner of this mask would no doubt be prepared to pay a small fortune to have it returned.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Sunken Mask
msgctxt "Item:32082:0:0"
msgid "sunken mask"
msgstr "затонувшая маска"

