#. ja: オラクルクラブ
#. de: Kultkrabbe
#. fr: crabe oraculaire
#. column 2: oracular crabs
#. column 8: While bloodpolish crabs are certainly frightening, this larger and more violent relative is nothing less than a nightmare come to life.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
