msgstr "Скальдминни"

#. ja: セレーテッドクラム
#. de: Sägemuschel
#. fr: palourde crantée
#. column 2: serrated clams
#. column 8: While this clam may look far more imposing than most, one must remind oneself that it is still only a clam, and only capable of causing a very limited amount of harm. Still, it is best to watch one's fingers, all the same.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
