msgstr "Истребитель"

#. ja: ゴーリィトゥーナ
#. de: derb[a] Thunfisch
#. fr: thon rubis
#. column 2: gory tuna
#. column 8: To survive amongst such vicious company, this fish needs to be tough, which some would say is reflected in the texture of its meat.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Gory Tuna
msgctxt "Item:32091:0:0"
msgid "gory tuna"
msgstr "кровавый тунец"

