#. ja: クォーツハンマーヘッド
#. de: Quarzhammerhai
#. fr: requin-marteau de quartz
#. column 2: quartz hammerheads
#. column 8: This shark possesses extraordinarily strong neck muscles, which it needs to stop itself being dragged down to the seabed by its weighty head.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on extra large canvases.]
#. column 9: Quartz Hammerhead
msgctxt "Item:32093:0:0"
msgid "quartz hammerhead"
msgstr "кварцевый акула-молот"

