#. ja: オーシャントード
#. de: hochseetüchtig[a] Frosch
#. fr: crapaud de mer
#. column 2: seafaring toads
#. column 8: The first sailors to spy one of these odd creatures at sea thought they had taken leave of their senses, or at the very least, had taken a wrong turn and somehow ended up in a pond.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Seafaring Toad
msgctxt "Item:32094:0:0"
msgid "seafaring toad"
msgstr "морской жаб"

