#. ja: ロズリトケルプ
#. de: Rothlyt-Alge
#. fr: touffe de varech de Rothlyt
#. column 2: strips of Rothlyt kelp
#. column 8: There are far easier ways to gather kelp than by reeling it in clump by clump, but most fishers will gladly accept such a “catch” rather than throw it back into the sea.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Rothlyt Kelp
msgctxt "Item:32096:0:0"
msgid "strip of Rothlyt kelp"
msgstr "полоска водорослей Ротлита"

