msgctxt "Item:32106:0:9"
msgid "Smooth Jaguar"
msgstr "Морской ягуар"

#. ja: ロズリトムール
#. de: Rothlyt-Muschel
#. fr: moule de Rothlyt
#. column 2: Rothlyt mussels
#. column 8: Many fishmongers pride themselves on using every part of the creatures in which they deal. In the case of the mussel, however, there are only two parts to worry about: the shell and the...squishy thing inside.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
