#. de: Leviaal
#. fr: lévicivelle
#. column 2: levi elvers
#. column 8: Of all the species of eel, levi elvers are said to most closely resemble Leviathan, although their much-reduced size does make them rather less imposing.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
