#. ja: パールボム
#. de: Perlenbomber
#. fr: châtaigne-perlière
#. column 2: pearl bombfish
#. column 8: Although bombfish do not actually explode in the same way as their namesakes, they look as if they could were they so inclined, which is enough to deter many would-be predators.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Pearl Bombfish
msgctxt "Item:32109:0:0"
msgid "pearl bombfish"
msgstr "жемчужная рыба-бомба"

