#. ja: 古びた剣【再】
#. de: Schwert[p] der Spätantike
#. fr: épée antique de la Promesse
#. column 2: blades of lost antiquity
#. column 8: A golden blade forged by some ancient civilization, recovered from Eden's Promise. Though such weapons were once considered highly valuable, demand has dried up and they are now essentially worthless.
#. column 9: Blade of Lost Antiquity
msgctxt "Item:32155:0:0"
msgid "blade of lost antiquity"
msgstr "Клинок древности"

#. de: Schwerter[p] der Spätantike
#. fr: épées antiques de la Promesse
#. column 0: blade of lost antiquity
#. column 8: A golden blade forged by some ancient civilization, recovered from Eden's Promise. Though such weapons were once considered highly valuable, demand has dried up and they are now essentially worthless.
#. column 9: Blade of Lost Antiquity
msgctxt "Item:32155:0:2"
msgid "blades of lost antiquity"
msgstr "Клинки древности"

#. ja: エデン空間で入手した謎めいた剣。<br>かつて熱心に収集する好事家がいたが流行は過ぎ去り、今や取引する者はいない
#. de: Ein goldenes Schwert, das von einer antiken Zivilisation angefertigt und in Eden gefunden wurde. Einst rissen sich Sammler förmlich nach dieser Rarität, doch heutzutage findet man dafür keine Abnehmer mehr.
#. fr: Une mystérieuse épée récupérée lors de l'inspection d'Éden et du Grand Vide. Même si les col<shy>lec<shy>tion<shy>neurs se les arrachaient autrefois, elles ont depuis perdu en popularité, et plus personne ne les rachète.
#. column 0: blade of lost antiquity
#. column 2: blades of lost antiquity
#. column 9: Blade of Lost Antiquity
msgctxt "Item:32155:0:8"
msgid "A golden blade forged by some ancient civilization, recovered from Eden's Promise. Though such weapons were once considered highly valuable, demand has dried up and they are now essentially worthless."
msgstr "Золотой клинок, выкованный неизвестной древней цивилизацией и найденный в Обете Эдема. Когда-то такое оружие считалось чрезвычайно ценным, но спрос на него угас, и теперь оно практически ничего не стоит."

