#. de: Mowen-Marke[p] „Offenbarung“
#. fr: avoir de Mowen (révélateur)
#. column 2: Mowen's tokens (revelation)
#. column 8: A note of promise received from Mowen for the delivery of Allagan tomestones of revelation. However, due to the House of Splendors changing its policies, it is now worth less than the paper on which it is scribed.
#. column 9: Mowen's Token (Revelation)
msgctxt "Item:32159:0:0"
msgid "Mowen's token (revelation)"
msgstr "Жетон Моуэн (Откровение)"

#. de: Mowen-Marken[p] „Offenbarung“
#. fr: avoirs de Mowen (révélateurs)
#. column 0: Mowen's token (revelation)
#. column 8: A note of promise received from Mowen for the delivery of Allagan tomestones of revelation. However, due to the House of Splendors changing its policies, it is now worth less than the paper on which it is scribed.
#. column 9: Mowen's Token (Revelation)
msgctxt "Item:32159:0:2"
msgid "Mowen's tokens (revelation)"
msgstr "Жетоны Моуэн (Откровение)"

#. ja: アラガントームストーン:黙示を納品した証となる商人モーエンの手形だった紙切れ。<br>引き換え期限が終了し、今や取引には利用できない
#. de: Von Mowen für die Abgabe Allagischer Steine der Offenbarung ausgegebene Bestätigungsmarke. Der Handel mit diesen Marken wurde beendet. Sie können daher nicht mehr eingetauscht werden.
#. fr: Cet avoir atteste que vous avez remis à Mowen des mémoquartz allagois révélateurs. Il pouvait être échangé contre des équipements de grande qualité, mais n'est désormais plus valable.
#. column 0: Mowen's token (revelation)
#. column 2: Mowen's tokens (revelation)
#. column 9: Mowen's Token (Revelation)
msgctxt "Item:32159:0:8"
msgid "A note of promise received from Mowen for the delivery of Allagan tomestones of revelation. However, due to the House of Splendors changing its policies, it is now worth less than the paper on which it is scribed."
msgstr "Записка, которую Моуэн выдавала в обмен на аллаганские камни откровений. Из-за смены правил в Торговом доме её теперь и на бумагу, на которой она написана, не обменять."

