#. ja: 超高速型トームストーン
#. de: schnellkristallisierend[a] Allagisch[a] Stein
#. fr: mémoquartz ultrarapide
#. column 2: defragmented tomestones
#. column 8: An artifact of Allagan technology, this tomestone was constructed to extremely exacting fifth-generation specifications. Data extraction can be completed in a mere fraction of the time required by other, less-advanced information storage units. This particular variety is not as highly sought as it once was, and may no longer be exchanged for other wares.
#. column 9: Defragmented Tomestone
msgctxt "Item:32160:0:0"
msgid "defragmented tomestone"
msgstr "Раздробленный камень"

#. de: schnellkristallisierend[a] Allagisch[a] Steine
