#. ja: 第四次復興用のクリア・ハルオネ
#. de: Himmelsang-Geisterfee
#. fr: fée fantôme de restauration (4e phase)
#. column 2: grade 4 skybuilders' ghost faeries
#. column 8: While some wavekin are able to change their color to blend in with their surroundings, the ghost faerie takes this one step further by being almost entirely transparent. In a cruel twist of fate, this also makes it almost impossible for them to find a mate, which goes some way to explaining their scarcity.<br><br>※Not included in the fish guide.
#. column 9: Grade 4 Skybuilders' Ghost Faerie
msgctxt "Item:32894:0:0"
msgid "grade 4 skybuilders' ghost faerie"
msgstr "Призрачная фея небесных строителей IV этапа"

