#. column 8: This wavekin's dark coloration serves as camouflage in the ocean depths, but the effect is lost if it ventures into shallower waters. There is also the fact that its internal organs will rupture due to the changes in water pressure, as if any further discouragement were needed.<br><br>※Not included in the fish guide.
