#. de: exklusiv[a] Tischdekoration[p] „Tawara Nezumi“
#. fr: mitsutawara de la fête de la transition spécial
#. column 2: authentic Heavensturn bounties
#. column 8: A traditional Heavensturn decoration meant to beckon fortune through its depiction of a traditional bumper crop of rice, traditionally infested by mice. In addition to the stuffed mouse included, it also attracts living mice, which some may find to be a nuisance, but it nevertheless adds to the overall authenticity of the piece.
#. column 9: Authentic Heavensturn Bounty
msgctxt "Item:32964:0:0"
